sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Scheduler as EventBridge
    participant Lambda as weekly-report
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant SES as Amazon SES
    participant Admin as Administrador

    Scheduler->>Lambda: Executa a rotina semanal
    Lambda->>DB: Consulta feedbacks do período
    DB-->>Lambda: Retorna os registros
    Lambda->>Lambda: Calcula média e agrupamentos
    Lambda->>SES: Envia o relatório consolidado
    SES-->>Admin: Entrega o e-mail semanal
